# Normalize line endings: LF in the repository and in the working tree, on
# every platform. Without this, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true
# writes CRLF files that Prettier then rejects (its endOfLine default is "lf"),
# and lint-staged's stash/restore cycle silently reconverts the whole tree.
#
# `text=auto` still lets git detect binary files and leave them alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
